{"signature": "{\"text\": \"Energy security means having sufficient energy available at an affordable cost when it is needed, with resilience to disruptions in supply. Reliability describes how consistently an energy source or system can deliver electricity when required. These are related but different ideas. A power station may be controllable yet still depend on imported fuel, while a variable renewable resource may contribute to a reliable electricity system when combined with storage, transmission and other generation.\", \"voice\": \"en-NG-AbeoNeural\", \"rate\": \"-4%\", \"eleven\": false}", "duration": 30.264, "words": [["Energy", 0.102083], ["security", 0.50575], ["means", 1.065625], ["having", 1.339083], ["sufficient", 1.6125], ["energy", 2.2245], ["available", 2.576041], ["at", 3.135958], ["an", 3.305208], ["affordable", 3.435416], ["cost", 3.995333], ["when", 4.307833], ["it", 4.464083], ["is", 4.620333], ["needed,", 4.776583], ["with", 5.453666], ["resilience", 5.675], ["to", 6.156791], ["disruptions", 6.287], ["in", 6.885958], ["supply.", 6.990125], ["Reliability", 8.4375], ["describes", 9.192708], ["how", 9.6875], ["consistently", 9.895833], ["an", 10.559916], ["energy", 10.729166], ["source", 11.106791], ["or", 11.458333], ["system", 11.575541], ["can", 12.044291], ["deliver", 12.252625], ["electricity", 12.591166], ["when", 13.255208], ["required.", 13.411458], ["These", 14.973958], ["are", 15.3125], ["related", 15.45575], ["but", 15.9245], ["different", 16.09375], ["ideas.", 16.497416], ["A", 18.085958], ["power", 18.28125], ["station", 18.541666], ["may", 18.932291], ["be", 19.114583], ["controllable", 19.244791], ["yet", 19.856791], ["still", 20.026041], ["depend", 20.338541], ["on", 20.677083], ["imported", 20.820333], ["fuel,", 21.302083], ["while", 21.940125], ["a", 22.109375], ["variable", 22.200541], ["renewable", 22.591166], ["resource", 23.046875], ["may", 23.463541], ["contribute", 23.632833], ["to", 24.153666], ["a", 24.270833], ["reliab